  "body": "Hi,\r\ni am running a Matrix Server for 2 weeks now and i am going to monitor the daily usage of Megabytes today. I found this calculator (https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1clrE4WFT7A5NS5AJUdU-mbDZ9rS9fzl6QEbUFJezo7U/edit#gid=0) on the web but i think its really hard to have a good calculation for maybe 2 or 3 years in the future.\r\n\r\nI wonder if there is some kind of content policy in synapse. I think it would be cool to have the possibility to say sth. like keep only last 4 weeks of image/video/audio content in a room. So the database / filesystem could be cleaned up to keep only latest attachments. Otherwise i could imagine that a well used Matrix server blows up to 500 GB and more over the time.\r\n\r\nWhat are your experiences / thoughts about that? I was not able to find something fitting in the present documentation.\r\n\r\nkind regards, Mario",
